{"seq":8,"slug":"anthropological-theory","title":"人类学理论","stage":"DONE","category":"anthropology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"人类学理论\">人类学理论</h1><p>人类学理论，是人类学家用以理解、解释人类文化与社会之多样性的思想框架与概念工具。面对一个陌生民族的奇异习俗，仅记录&quot;他们做了什么&quot;是不够的；人类学家还要回答&quot;为什么&quot;与&quot;意味着什么&quot;——这就离不开理论。从 1871 年泰勒《原始文化》给&quot;文化&quot;下学科定义，到 21 世纪的本体论转向，一部人类学理论史，就是一代代人类学家（泰勒、博厄斯、马林诺夫斯基、列维-斯特劳斯、格尔茨、布迪厄、福柯……）不断追问&quot;如何理解文化&quot;、并相互争鸣的历史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本知识库梳理人类学<strong>思想流派的历史脉络</strong>——各大理论&quot;如何理解文化&quot;的独特眼光及其相互批评、相互超越的争鸣。它面向希望理解人类学思想史、或对&quot;如何理解文化&quot;感兴趣的读者，无需专业训练。</p>\n<p>它<strong>不</strong>展开以下内容，这些由兄弟 hub 承担（本库只在相关处交叉链接，不重复展开）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想了解</th>\n<th>去这个兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>田野方法、参与观察、民族志写作的怎么做</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ethnography-and-fieldwork/\">民族志与田野工作</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亲属称谓、联姻、继嗣制度本身</td>\n<td><a href=\"../kinship-and-social-organization/\">亲属与社会组织</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巫术、仪式、神话的宗教学内容</td>\n<td><a href=\"../anthropology-of-religion/\">宗教人类学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权力、国家、殖民的政治学内容</td>\n<td><a href=\"../political-anthropology/\">政治人类学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言与文化的关系</td>\n<td><a href=\"../linguistic-anthropology/\">语言人类学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>礼物、交换、资本的经济学内容</td>\n<td><a href=\"../economic-anthropology/\">经济人类学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文化概念、文化相对论的应用</td>\n<td><a href=\"../cultural-anthropology/\">文化人类学</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：本库讲<strong>理论本身的来龙去脉</strong>，兄弟 hub 讲<strong>这些理论应用到的具体领域</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>理论之间是层层叠加、相互回应的关系，建议顺序阅读：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  C1[1.基础: 何为理论/争鸣史] --&gt; C2[2.进化论与传播论]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C3[3.功能主义]&#10;  C3 --&gt; C4[4.结构主义]&#10;  C4 --&gt; C5[5.阐释与当代: 意义-权力]&#10;  C1 -.总纲.-&gt; C5\">flowchart LR\n  C1[1.基础: 何为理论/争鸣史] --&gt; C2[2.进化论与传播论]\n  C2 --&gt; C3[3.功能主义]\n  C3 --&gt; C4[4.结构主义]\n  C4 --&gt; C5[5.阐释与当代: 意义-权力]\n  C1 -.总纲.-&gt; C5</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无硬性前置；若对&quot;文化&quot;概念本身陌生，可先浏览 <a href=\"../cultural-anthropology/\">文化人类学</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第一章 <a href=\"foundations/\">人类学理论基础</a></strong>：界定理论的含义、它使人类学<a href=\"foundations/from-description-to-explanation\">从描述上升为解释</a>的作用，以及理论史作为<a href=\"foundations/a-history-of-debate\">一部争鸣史</a>的整体面貌（含理论史的&quot;钟摆&quot;总纲）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 <a href=\"evolutionism-and-diffusion/\">进化论与传播论</a></strong>：最早两大流派（泰勒、摩尔根、弗雷泽 vs 博厄斯、传播论），回答&quot;文化多样从何而来&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 <a href=\"functionalism/\">功能主义</a></strong>：从&quot;历史溯源&quot;到&quot;现实功能&quot;的转向（马林诺夫斯基、拉德克利夫-布朗），及田野范式的确立。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 <a href=\"structuralism/\">结构主义</a></strong>：在现象背后寻找普遍&quot;深层结构&quot;的大胆思辨（列维-斯特劳斯、二元对立）。</li>\n<li><strong>第五章 <a href=\"interpretive-and-contemporary/\">阐释人类学与当代理论</a></strong>：把目光拉回&quot;意义&quot;（格尔茨、深描），再转向<a href=\"interpretive-and-contemporary/power-practice-agency\">权力、实践与能动性</a>（布迪厄、福柯），并<a href=\"interpretive-and-contemporary/significance\">总结整部理论史的意义</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本库，你将获得一条理解人类学思想史的清晰线索，也将对&quot;如何理解一种文化&quot;这一根本问题，拥有功能的、结构的、意义的、权力的多重深刻视角——而非选定一种&quot;最正确&quot;的理论，而是把它们统统纳入自己理解文化的工具箱。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"人类学理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-theory","title":"什么是人类学理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/foundations/what-is-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"from-description-to-explanation","title":"从描述到理解与解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/foundations/from-description-to-explanation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"a-history-of-debate","title":"理论作为一部争鸣史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/foundations/a-history-of-debate"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"evolutionism-and-diffusion","title":"进化论与传播论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/evolutionism-and-diffusion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cultural-evolutionism","title":"文化进化论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/evolutionism-and-diffusion/cultural-evolutionism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"critiques-and-diffusionism","title":"进化论的反思与传播论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/evolutionism-and-diffusion/critiques-and-diffusionism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"legacy","title":"早期理论的遗产与问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/evolutionism-and-diffusion/legacy"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"functionalism","title":"功能主义","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/functionalism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-origin-to-function","title":"从历史溯源到现实功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/functionalism/from-origin-to-function"},{"seq":2,"slug":"function-and-needs","title":"功能与需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/functionalism/function-and-needs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contributions-and-limits","title":"功能主义的贡献与局限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/functionalism/contributions-and-limits"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"structuralism","title":"结构主义","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/structuralism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-structures","title":"寻找深层结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/structuralism/deep-structures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"binary-oppositions","title":"二元对立与心智","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/structuralism/binary-oppositions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"significance-and-critique","title":"结构主义的意义与批评","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/structuralism/significance-and-critique"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"interpretive-and-contemporary","title":"阐释人类学与当代理论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/interpretive-and-contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-as-meaning","title":"文化作为意义之网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/interpretive-and-contemporary/culture-as-meaning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interpretation-and-thick-description","title":"阐释与深描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/interpretive-and-contemporary/interpretation-and-thick-description"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-practice-agency","title":"权力、实践与能动性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/interpretive-and-contemporary/power-practice-agency"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"人类学理论的意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/anthropological-theory/interpretive-and-contemporary/significance"}]}]}